Tree Patterns

Know these patterns:

Pattern 1: Traverse
Visit node
Go left
Go right

Examples:

Count nodes
Sum nodes
Search

Pattern 2: Bottom-Up
left answer
right answer

combine
return

Examples:

Height
Diameter
Balanced Tree


Pattern 3: Level Order
Queue

while queue not empty
    process current level
    push children

Examples:

Zigzag
Right Side View
Average of Levels

5. Binary Search Tree

Know these operations:

Search
Insert
Delete
Floor
Ceil
Kth Smallest
Validate BST

6. Important Tree Problems

You should be comfortable with:

Easy:

Maximum Depth
Same Tree
Symmetric Tree
Invert Tree
Path Sum
Count Nodes

Medium:

Diameter
Balanced Tree
LCA
Binary Tree Right Side View
Zigzag Traversal
Construct Tree
Serialize & Deserialize
Kth Smallest (BST)

Hard:

Max Path Sum
Vertical Order Traversal